<!-- ============ REASON 1 — texto esquerda / imagem direita / fundo branco ============ -->
<section class="rsn">
  <div class="rsn-in">
    <div class="rsn-txt">
      <span class="rsn-num">Reason 1</span>
      <h2 class="rsn-h">It's the Same 4 Herbs Native Americans<br>and European Healers Used for Centuries</h2>
      <p>There are hundreds of lymphatic system supplements on the market, but only <b>ONE</b> addresses all four stages of obstruction: Linfaflow®. It is composed of four wild-harvested herbs sourced from the southeastern United States and European fields, each serving a specific function.</p>
      <p><b>Here's why that matters:</b><br>Your lymphatic system doesn't have a pump like your heart does. It relies on movement, muscle contractions, and internal flow to push fluid through your body. When that flow slows down — from age, sitting all day, or standing for hours — thick, stagnant fluid builds up around your vessels like sludge in old pipes.</p>
      <p><b>One herb can't fix that. You need four, working in sequence:</b></p>
      <ul class="rsnb">
        <li><span class="rsnb-ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11"/></svg></span><div><b>Breaks down hardened lymphatic sludge clogging your vessels</b><span>Stillingia Root targets the thick, stagnant fluid that has hardened around your lymphatic pathways</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="rsnb-ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11"/></svg></span><div><b>Sweeps loose toxins through congested kidney drainage channels</b><span>Cleavers acts like a lymphatic broom, clearing the debris that's been mobilized</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="rsnb-ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11"/></svg></span><div><b>Activates sluggish lymph flow so waste actually moves</b><span>Prickly Ash Bark sparks circulation and internal movement in a system that has no pump of its own</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="rsnb-ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11"/></svg></span><div><b>Purifies blood and eliminates toxic debris recirculating in the system</b><span>Red Clover supports the body's natural cleansing processes and healthy blood flow</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="rsnb-ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11"/></svg></span><div><b>Reduces puffiness and heaviness in legs, ankles, face and hands</b><span>The combined action supports fluid balance so you feel lighter from morning to night</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="rsnb-ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11"/></svg></span><div><b>Supports natural energy and mental clarity</b><span>When lymph moves, brain fog lifts, fatigue fades, and you feel like yourself again</span></div></li>
      </ul>
      <p>Whether your legs look like overstuffed sausages by 5pm, your face is puffy every morning, or you just feel heavy, bloated and drained, you need a formula that works from the inside out.</p>
      <p>Compression socks squeeze from the outside. Elevation moves fluid temporarily. Diuretics just flush water and destroy your electrolytes. Linfaflow® is the only formula that targets all 4 stages of the blockage itself.</p>
      <p class="rsn-pull">Diuretics and compression treat the symptom. Linfaflow® targets the sludge.</p>
      <a class="btn-r" href="#offer">Try Linfaflow® <em>Risk-Free For 90 Days</em> <span class="arr">→</span></a>
      <p class="rsn-sup"><span class="ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11"/></svg></span>Herbs Clinically Studied</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rsn-med"><img src="[IMG]" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ REASON 2 — imagem esquerda / texto direita / fundo escuro ============ -->
<section class="rsn dark rev">
  <div class="rsn-in">
