      <span class="rsn-num">Reason 2</span>
      <h2 class="rsn-h">Liquid Drops Absorb In Seconds<br>(So You Actually Feel It Working)</h2>
      <p>Common pills usually contain only a single generic herb, losing up to <b>80% of their active ingredients</b> to stomach acid during ingestion.</p>
      <p>Linfaflow® puts four full-spectrum botanical extracts in liquid drop form. Place them under your tongue (tastes like honey), hold for 30 seconds, and the actives absorb directly, bypassing the digestive bottleneck entirely. No pills to swallow. No bloated feeling. No waiting hours to see if anything happened.</p>
      <p>This means you can take it twice daily — 2 drops in the morning, 2 drops at night — in a simple 30-second ritual with a glass of water. The morning dose supports daytime circulation and energy. The night dose works while you sleep, so you wake up with a lighter face and less puffiness instead of the puffy, swollen look you've gotten used to.</p>
      <a class="btn-r" href="#offer">Wake Up To Lighter Legs <span class="arr">→</span></a>
