      <span class="rsn-num">Reason 3</span>
      <h2 class="rsn-h">The 4-Step Flush Works While You Sleep<br>(So You Wake Up With Lighter Legs)</h2>
      <p>When your lymphatic system has been congested for months or years, you can't just "flush" it in one shot. That's why most cleanses and detox teas make you feel worse — they stir everything up with nothing to catch the debris.</p>
      <p><b>Linfaflow®'s 4-step system works in sequence:</b></p>
