      </div>
      <p>The result: you go to bed with heavy, swollen legs — and wake up feeling lighter, less puffy, and more like yourself. No compression torture. No water pills destroying your kidneys. No expensive clinic visits. Just 4 drops and a glass of water.</p>
      <a class="btn-r" href="#offer">No More Heavy Legs By 5PM <span class="arr">→</span></a>
