      <p>Here's the dirty secret nobody talks about: most "lymphatic support" formulas are mostly filler. Cheap binders, synthetic flow agents, and just enough of the real herbs to legally list them on the label. The active botanicals you're paying for? <b>Barely there.</b></p>
