<!-- ============ REASON 5 — texto esquerda / imagem direita / fundo branco ============ -->
<section class="rsn">
  <div class="rsn-in">
    <div class="rsn-txt">
      <span class="rsn-num">Reason 5</span>
      <h2 class="rsn-h">It Works From the INSIDE<br>(Where Compression and Elevation Can't Reach)</h2>
      <p>Here's what nobody tells you about compression socks, leg elevation, dry brushing, massage: they only move fluid that's already near the surface. They squeeze and push from the outside. But the congestion — the thick, stagnant sludge clogging your lymphatic vessels — is deep inside.</p>
      <p>It's like sweeping mud off a wet floor: the broom just smears it into a bigger streak.</p>
      <p><b>Linfaflow® works from within.</b> The four botanicals enter your system and target the congestion at its source:</p>
      <ul class="rsnb tight">
        <li><span class="rsnb-ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11"/></svg></span><div><span>Deep inside the lymphatic vessels where hardened fluid has been sitting for months</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="rsnb-ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11"/></svg></span><div><span>Along the kidney drainage channels where toxins need to be eliminated</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="rsnb-ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11"/></svg></span><div><span>Through the circulatory system to activate flow in a system that has no pump</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="rsnb-ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11"/></svg></span><div><span>In the bloodstream to purify and prevent toxic recirculation</span></div></li>
