<!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
<section class="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="display sec-head">Questions? <span class="accent">Answered.</span></h2>

    <div class="faq-group">The Product</div>
    <details class="qa"><summary>How is this different from a water pill or a diuretic?</summary><div class="a">A water pill tells your kidneys to pull fluid out of your blood and send it to your bladder. That's the whole mechanism — which is why you spend the day in the bathroom and wake up puffier than you started. The puffiness isn't in your blood; it's parked in your tissue, and the drain that's supposed to collect it is the one that stalled. Linfaflow® works on that drain instead. No bathroom sprints, no dehydration, nothing to rebound from.</div></details>
    <details class="qa"><summary>What's in it — and is it safe?</summary><div class="a">Four plant extracts and nothing else: cleavers to move the trapped fluid, stillingia root to open the deeper pathways, red clover blossom for the surface puffiness in your face, and prickly ash bark to power the flow. No stimulants, no caffeine, no added sugar, no alcohol, no gluten, no artificial additives. Vegan-friendly, non-GMO, made in the USA, and every batch is third-party tested before it ships.</div></details>
    <details class="qa"><summary>How fast will I see results?</summary><div class="a">Most women notice the morning puffiness easing in the first week — the face "recovery hour" gets shorter. Around week two the leg and ankle swelling starts coming down and the sock marks fade. By week three the skin looks clearer and the energy holds. 89% report feeling lighter and less swollen in 16 days or less. This is a system restarting, not a flush, so consistency is what makes it stick.</div></details>
    <details class="qa"><summary>Will it make me run to the bathroom all day like a diuretic?</summary><div class="a">No — and that's the whole point of the design. Diuretics work by pushing your kidneys to dump water. Linfaflow® supports your lymphatic drainage instead, so the fluid leaves the way your body was built to move it. Most women notice no change in bathroom trips at all.</div></details>
    <details class="qa"><summary>What's the guarantee?</summary><div class="a">Take Linfaflow® for a full 90 days. If you don't wake up less puffy, if the sock marks don't fade, if you don't feel lighter by 3pm — if you're not happy for any reason at all — email us and we'll refund every penny. Even if the bottles are empty.</div></details>

    <div class="faq-group">Daily Use</div>
    <details class="qa"><summary>How do I take it?</summary><div class="a">Twice a day — 2 drops in the morning, 2 drops at night. Hold them under your tongue for about thirty seconds, then swallow with a glass of water. It tastes like honey. No powders to mix, no pills to swallow, nothing to add to your routine. The morning dose supports daytime circulation; the night dose works while you sleep.</div></details>
    <details class="qa"><summary>Can I take it with my other supplements or medications?</summary><div class="a">Linfaflow® is made from plant extracts and works alongside most daily supplements without any issue. If you're on prescription medication — especially a diuretic, a blood pressure medication, or a blood thinner — check with your doctor first, the same as you would with any new supplement.</div></details>
    <details class="qa"><summary>Is it safe for daily use?</summary><div class="a">Yes. It's designed as a daily ritual, not a cleanse. There's no harsh flush, no dehydration, and nothing to cycle off of.</div></details>

    <div class="faq-group">Ordering</div>
    <details class="qa"><summary>If I subscribe, can I pause or cancel anytime?</summary><div class="a">Yes — anytime, no phone calls and no hoops. Pause, skip a month, or cancel from your account in a couple of clicks. Subscribing locks in your discount and makes sure you never run out mid-reset, which is exactly when most women lose their progress.</div></details>
    <details class="qa"><summary>When will my order arrive?</summary><div class="a">Orders placed before the cutoff ship the same business day. Most US orders arrive in 3–5 business days. You'll get tracking by email the moment it leaves our facility.</div></details>
    <details class="qa"><summary>What if it doesn't work for me?</summary><div class="a">Then it costs you nothing. You're covered by the full 90-day guarantee — one email and you're refunded. The risk sits with us, not you.</div></details>

    <a class="btn" href="#offer" style="margin-top:26px">Claim My Linfaflow® <span class="arr">→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>


